    doc = "A worn in-service Brembo 09.7012.11 280 mm dia internally vented front brake rotor (22.0 mm new, 21.50 mm at the eight inspection points in the sim, 19 mm discard, 65 mm centre bore, 5 x 100 mm stud holes, 5.74 kg estimated grey cast iron), installed on a wheel hub and steering knuckle. Axis along y (the hat toward -y); fixed. Origin: the middle of the rotor's thickness, on its axis. Eight 2 mm scribe marks and one 6 mm paint dot at radius 135 mm show the inspection points; the dot marks the thinnest one. The hat outer diameter and 36 vanes are visual approximations."
)
